<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.1 Social Intelligence Benchmarks ‣ 5 Related Work ‣ SI-Bench: Benchmarking Social Intelligence of Large Language Models in Human-to-Human Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Interactive Tasks</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In 5 Related Work ‣ SI-Bench: Benchmarking Social Intelligence of Large Language Models in Human-to-Human Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2 </span>Effectiveness of CoT in Dialogue</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In SI-Bench: Benchmarking Social Intelligence of Large Language Models in Human-to-Human Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
