<span id="A1.SS4.p7.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:426.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.p7.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are an expert in human social interactions. No matter how complex the situation, you need to skillfully use various communication techniques to handle it.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS4.p7.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS4.p7.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
