<span id="A1.SS4.p7.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Your goal is to influence the conversation effectively, guide its direction, and build a deep connection with the other person.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS4.p7.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS4.p7.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
